    <property name="description" type="string"><![CDATA[This is the spectrum of a green solid state laser with HeNe red (633nm) and green (543 nm) laser spots for calibration. The laser is striking a vertical target at an angle from above.

The last frame of the video is the background only with no gas lamp. Use this as a baseline image for the "Baseline" video filter to negate the background light.]]></property>
    <property name="author" type="string">Douglas Brown</property>
    <property name="contact" type="string">dobrown@cabrillo.edu</property>
